@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
left to right direction

card "C1 检查\n（有效样本 < 20%\n=> 安全意图 OFF）" as C1
card "安全 OFF\n（逻辑结果）" as SO
card "OFF 请求\n已发送" as TX
card "ACK /\n寄存器回读" as ACK
card "负载反馈\n（触点、动作、流量）" as LF

C1 --> SO
SO --> TX
TX --> ACK
ACK --> LF
note bottom of ACK
  只声明到有证据的最后一个阶段，
  例如“已收到 OFF 请求 ACK；
  实际停止未确认”。
end note
@enduml
